{"id":"wirklichkeit","lemma":"Wirklichkeit","pos":"noun","rank":2000,"glosses":["reality"],"ipa":"/ˈvɪʁklɪçˌkaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4b/De-at-Wirklichkeit.ogg/De-at-Wirklichkeit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Wirklichkeit","plural":"Wirklichkeiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Traum wurde Wirklichkeit.","en":"The dream has become a reality.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dream"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null]},{"text":"Wie können wir diesen Traum Wirklichkeit werden lassen?","en":"How can we change this dream into reality?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"dream"},null,{"g":"to become"},{"g":"to allow"}]},{"text":"In Wirklichkeit sind sie nur an Macht interessiert.","en":"In reality, all they are interested in is power.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"interested"}]},{"text":"In Wirklichkeit lag ich falsch.","en":"Actually, I was wrong.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"false"}]},{"text":"Ich verstehe es in Wirklichkeit einfach nicht.","en":"I just don't really understand.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear and interpret","l":"verstehen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"easy"},{"g":"not"}]}]}